                <mxCell id="g85OO_5E283azgmpjkhN-95" value="&lt;span style='font-size:8px;color:#666'&gt;MOSFET Source&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="485" y="983" width="70" height="12" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="g85OO_5E283azgmpjkhN-96" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px;color:#1B5E20'&gt;📋 WIRING CHANGES — Step by Step (Rev B):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='color:#C62828'&gt;1. DISCONNECT from Gate:&lt;/b&gt; Remove &lt;b&gt;GREEN wire&lt;/b&gt; from MOSFET &lt;b&gt;Gate (G)&lt;/b&gt; pin — it goes to Relay IN B instead. Remove any &lt;b&gt;104 (100kΩ)&lt;/b&gt; pull-up resistors from Gate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='color:#2E7D32'&gt;2. MOVE GREEN (control):&lt;/b&gt; Connect &lt;b&gt;GREEN wire&lt;/b&gt; from &lt;b&gt;Terminal 13 (BCM 27)&lt;/b&gt; to Monk Makes &lt;b&gt;Relay IN B&lt;/b&gt; pin (same as old orange gimbal control wire location).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='color:#1565C0'&gt;3. NEW +3.3V feed:&lt;/b&gt; Run a &lt;b&gt;new wire&lt;/b&gt; from &lt;b&gt;Terminal 17 (+3.3V)&lt;/b&gt; to Relay CH2 screw &lt;b&gt;B1&lt;/b&gt;. &lt;b&gt;Do NOT&lt;/b&gt; connect T17 to Gate — T17 is power, not GPIO.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='color:#7B1FA2'&gt;4. NEW Gate drive:&lt;/b&gt; Run a &lt;b&gt;new wire&lt;/b&gt; from Relay CH2 screw &lt;b&gt;B2&lt;/b&gt; to MOSFET &lt;b&gt;Gate (G)&lt;/b&gt; left pin.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='color:#C62828'&gt;5. REMOVE old CH2 12V:&lt;/b&gt; Disconnect any &lt;b&gt;+12V red wire&lt;/b&gt; from Relay B1 (old gimbal feed). CH2 now switches 3.3V only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='color:#E65100'&gt;6. OPTIONAL pull-down:&lt;/b&gt; Solder &lt;b&gt;10kΩ (103)&lt;/b&gt; Gate→GND if you have one — keeps valve closed when relay OFF.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='color:#1565C0'&gt;7–9. UNCHANGED:&lt;/b&gt; MOSFET Drain→Solenoid(−), Source→GND, Solenoid(+)→+12V, 1N4007 flyback, YELLOW pump wire.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#388E3C;font-size:10px'&gt;✅ &lt;b&gt;Test:&lt;/b&gt; Click Test 500ms → Gate ~3.3V, Drain ~0V, &lt;b&gt;two audible clicks&lt;/b&gt;. Software unchanged (still BCM 27).&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F8E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;fontColor=#333;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="65" y="1055" width="1150" height="250" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
